<details id="source-review-panel" class="source-review-panel"><summary>Review claims against sources</summary>
<p class="small">Choose a short claim, compare it with your source, and record your judgment. Saved records use the existing private review notes: 12 notes total, 500 characters each. They stay in backups, checkpoints, and saved collection entries; article exports exclude them. <a href="/help/draft-checks/#source-review" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Passage review help (new tab)</a></p>
<p class="small">This is a record of your review, not independent fact-checking. Recheck decisions after editing the article or source. An exact text match does not establish accuracy or support.</p>
<div class="source-review-compare">
<div><button id="pin-review-passage" type="button" class="secondary" disabled>Use selected article passage</button><label for="review-passage">Exact article passage, up to 240 characters</label><textarea id="review-passage" disabled rows="5" maxlength="240" aria-describedby="source-review-status"></textarea></div>
<div><label for="review-source-notes">Current source notes for comparison</label><textarea id="review-source-notes" rows="5" readonly placeholder="Add source notes, or describe a source you checked elsewhere." aria-describedby="review-source-help"></textarea><button id="edit-review-source" type="button" class="secondary" disabled>Edit full source notes</button><button id="pin-review-evidence" type="button" class="secondary" disabled>Use selected source text as evidence</button><p id="review-source-help" class="small">Select a short excerpt above, or enter evidence from a source you checked yourself. Edit the full source notes under Source notes &amp; review.</p></div>
</div>
<label for="review-source-reference">Source reference, up to 160 characters</label><input id="review-source-reference" disabled maxlength="160" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Document name and page, interview date, or URL">
<label for="review-evidence">Evidence or explanation, up to 240 characters</label><textarea id="review-evidence" disabled rows="3" maxlength="240" placeholder="What does the source establish, contradict, or leave uncertain?"></textarea>
<label for="review-decision">Your decision for this passage</label><select id="review-decision" disabled><option>Needs checking</option><option>Supported by this source</option><option>Needs revision</option><option>Remove or qualify</option></select>
<p id="source-review-status" class="small" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">Passage review is loading. Ordinary review notes remain available.</p>
<div class="actions"><button id="save-source-review" type="button" class="secondary" disabled>Save private review note</button><button id="refresh-source-review" type="button" class="secondary" disabled>Recheck against current writing</button><button id="cancel-source-review" type="button" class="secondary" disabled>Discard this unsaved review</button></div>
<p class="small">Preparing a review does not change writing or approval. Save adds or updates a private note, keeps a checkpoint, and clears approval. Unsaved fields above are excluded from backups. Shorten the combined record to 500 characters; no text is silently truncated. Source references stay as text and are never opened or checked here.</p>
<h3>Saved passage reviews</h3><p id="source-review-count" class="small">No saved passage reviews yet.</p><ol id="source-review-records" class="source-review-records" aria-label="Saved private passage reviews"></ol>
</details>
